WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.190
[Wet With Regret from Closer To Me Than Him plays]

00:00:03.190 --> 00:00:07.385
[muffled music]

00:00:07.385 --> 00:00:08.500
[ding-dong]

00:00:10.310 --> 00:00:13.376
[getting up noises]

00:00:13.376 --> 00:00:16.158
[muffled getting up noises]

00:00:16.158 --> 00:00:17.690
[getting up noises]

00:00:25.370 --> 00:00:27.033
[crash]

00:00:28.150 --> 00:00:29.830
Heeeiii gaiz!

00:00:29.935 --> 00:00:30.995
How you doing?

00:00:30.995 --> 00:00:32.014
Welcome to LA!

00:00:32.014 --> 00:00:32.873
[squeaky nipples]

00:00:32.873 --> 00:00:33.942
Come on in!

00:00:36.725 --> 00:00:38.905
My home is your home. Get ready for...

00:00:38.905 --> 00:00:42.395
...a week of amazing video gaming.

00:00:42.395 --> 00:00:44.505
[pure amazement]

00:00:44.505 --> 00:00:46.501
You don't even know it's gonna happen!

00:00:46.501 --> 00:00:46.997
[neck snaps]

00:00:46.997 --> 00:00:48.513
OH, it's good to see you!

00:00:48.513 --> 00:00:51.253
You know, I've always respected you as a person.

00:00:51.843 --> 00:00:58.593
[epic slow mo is epic]

00:01:00.468 --> 00:01:04.468
DAAAENIEALH, good to see ya!

00:01:07.595 --> 00:01:11.115
OH, you've always been a good little boy.

00:01:11.287 --> 00:01:12.887
Put it there!

00:01:12.907 --> 00:01:16.986
[epic slow mo is still epic]

00:01:16.986 --> 00:01:19.215
[...and triumphant, too!]

00:01:24.755 --> 00:01:25.145
[Wade pops up]

00:01:26.125 --> 00:01:28.019
What the fuck are you doing here Wade?!

00:01:28.479 --> 00:01:34.511
[epic slow mo is not so epic now, is it? :D]

00:01:34.511 --> 00:01:40.543
[btw the song is Glub Glub Water Dance,
goddammit stop asking :D]

00:01:45.613 --> 00:01:46.575
[ding-dong]

00:01:50.524 --> 00:01:56.512
[epic slow mo is definitely epic again]

00:02:08.242 --> 00:02:10.370
[normal speed touching commences]

00:02:13.281 --> 00:02:16.230
[laughing]

00:02:16.260 --> 00:02:17.019
It's whe...

00:02:17.019 --> 00:02:19.670
It's when you squeeze my face that makes me laugh.

